Focus Experiment: Option C (Failure threshold)

Goal: Plot the dependence of the "failure rate - error rate" on the threshold and select the threshold that minimizes total costs.

---

1. Testable Hypothesis

"There is an optimal retrieval confidence threshold (e.g., 0.7) that minimizes the total operational costs by balancing the high cost of AI errors (hallucinations) against the lower cost of manual operator escalations."

